      "value": "Being able to switch joystick bindings would be fantastic also for those of us with limited or no use of a hand.  \n\nIt's easy to move around using just the left joystick.. if you have a left hand - those of us who don't are stuck with just swapping the sticks in via Steam, but this makes everything else that requires joysticks really awkward to use.  And of course this isn't doable at all with Quest.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
